💡Key Insights 
-DIAGEO NORTH AMERICA INC was the top vendor by sales, generating approximately $68.74M in sales and $17.78M in gross profit.
-CONSTELLATION BRANDS INC achieved a 36.35% profit margin among the major vendors analyzed.
-SOUTHERN GLAZERS W&S OF NE showed an unusually high 99.29% profit margin, which may require further investigation due to its comparatively low recorded purchase value.
-Freight costs for many major vendors were approximately 0.5% of purchase dollars.
-Vendor-level analysis helps identify both high-performing suppliers and vendors with potential profitability or cost concerns.

✅Conclusion
This project demonstrates an end-to-end Data Analytics workflow, from data cleaning and exploratory analysis to SQL-based analysis and Power BI visualization. The analysis provides a consolidated view of vendor performance and highlights opportunities related to sales growth, profitability, purchasing, freight costs, and vendor management.
